\contentsline {section}{: Your phone VPN encrypted tunnel VPN server target website. The data is encrypted and encapsulated, so “peeping toms” can only see a bunch of garbled text. Additionally, the target website sees the IP address of the VPN server, not your real IP.}{178}{section*.47}%
\contentsline {section}{cannot directly read your chat content or payment password}{179}{section*.47}%
\contentsline {section}{After verification passes, both parties use public key encryption to negotiate a “session key,” and all subsequent communication is encrypted with this key.}{180}{section*.47}%
\contentsline {section}{! This means your ISP, Wi-Fi provider, or any intermediate node can see which websites you've visited.}{180}{Item.268}%
